{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o039c","title":"满宠欲弃新城曹叡令坚守","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o039c-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"满宠欲弃新城曹叡令坚守","evidence":["mingdi-e-o039c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0038","role":"建议","evidence":["mingdi-e-o039c-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"不许弃守","evidence":["mingdi-e-o039c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":234,"label":"六月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o037","basis":"六月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o039c-q","mingdi-q-o037","mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o039c-q","source_order":[3,269,"O039c"],"order":861}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0038","name":"满宠","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o039c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5bf6d1ed2ab463eadb39","layer":"original","quote":"五月，太白昼现。孙权入居巢湖口〖1〗，向合肥新城〖2〗；又遣将陆议、孙韶各将万余人入淮、沔〖3〗。六月，征东将军满宠进军拒之〖4〗。宠欲拔新城守〖5〗，致贼寿春〖6〗。帝不听，曰：“昔汉光武遣兵悬据略阳〖7〗，终以破隗嚣〖8〗。先帝东置合肥，南守襄阳，西固祁山〖9〗；贼来辄破于三城之下者〖10〗，地有所必争也。纵权攻新城，必不能拔；敕诸将坚守，吾将自往征之；比至，恐权走也。”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":189,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
